    "text": "The conductor called “all aboard” in the middle of me taking this photo\nRai Wandeler is a Junior Engineering major at Harvey Mudd College who has in their folly decided to delve into the deep world of magic electronics. This is where this website comes into play. As a part of the Microprocessor Systems: Design & Applications class, students progress and experience is to be documented in a personal blog. This will outline my progress in the various labs and any other stuff that I chose to write here over time.\nOutside of this class I enjoy theatre and various engineering projects. I love repairing machines, photography, talking about larger topics, and making stuff."
